[{"client_msg_id":"d0219f88-20e8-4646-bac6-d6c401db91a9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"身の回りにも実はたくさんありそうだなあ","ts":"1635432482.058400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CaK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a943a18-f0fe-465f-aec8-db793885bc94","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"でもちょっと混在している時期があるんだよなぁ。","ts":"1635432213.057400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22668612-6d59-4ff4-9a5f-2315e1c4011b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たしかにS型番はまだ冷陰極管な気がする。EVが最初のLEDモデルで…オフィスにあるけどちょっと色味が劣ったんだよな。","ts":"1635432167.056200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YJU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c5082d8-b12d-4609-9948-0be1d9dc228f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"半導体工学の教科書を久々に引っ張り出して眺めていた、懐かしい","ts":"1635432119.054300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jga"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa06d8a8-c86f-4b53-b6aa-ffe5aa733f02","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"我が家のEIZO S2242Wは2009年製なので多分冷陰極管。LEDは薄くて軽くてよい。","ts":"1635431806.053600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vc0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1e44094-bbed-4e11-a4b4-bf2b153348c7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もう作らんのか","ts":"1635430813.050500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVxN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acba53c3-f796-4fe5-9618-077c48831815","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; 必要な要素のすべてで発光ダイオードの方が優れているため、発光ダイオードを光源とする器具への移行が進んでいて、メーカーでは冷陰極管を使用した部品が生産中止となっている場合も多い。しかし日本も含め世界中には冷陰極管の需要と在庫があるので、光り方の近い蛍光灯の代わりや後進国の新製品などで用いる可能性はある。","ts":"1635430807.050200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MzPD9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37a64421-3240-4403-b63a-b4617adea5d8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"冷陰極管、たぶん未成年の頃には使ってたんだろうけど\nテクノロジーとか意識するころにはみんなLEDとか液晶だった","ts":"1635430741.049700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FuK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccb05bfb-5b54-4fbb-8254-97f73c00c8a7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"冷陰極管、LEDで遊んでた頃秋月電商で売ってたので買おうか迷ったけど遊びで扱う物ではないよなーと思ってやめた","ts":"1635430636.048400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xhyM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb0ec76e-f2f7-4a4e-be30-e4b6d0dfdba9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、語義はそうですよねw","ts":"1635430582.046800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tfip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa6f3d2c-2341-4541-83df-19624b520391","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"この場合の空は虚無みたいなものなので :disney: の方が近そう","ts":"1635430567.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"083e187c-c806-4131-91cf-6bc13b6f233a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もちろん白色LEDが無かったので、液晶のモニタの光源はこういうのでした。\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E9%99%B0%E6%A5%B5%E7%AE%A1\u003e","ts":"1635430541.045700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 冷陰極管","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"冷陰極管","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E9%99%B0%E6%A5%B5%E7%AE%A1","text":"冷陰極管（れいいんきょくかん）とは陰極からの電子の放出に外部からの加熱用エネルギーの供給を必要としない電子管の総称である。代表例としては、古くはクルックス管、ガイスラー管、ニキシー管、計数放電管、ネオン管、光電管、最初期のブラウン管などがある。冷陰極を使用した小型蛍光管が液晶バックライト用の光源として急速に発展し、発光ダイオードが一般的になるまでは多くの液晶パネルに搭載されていた。以下特に冷陰極蛍光管について述べる。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Cold_Cathode_Fluorescent_Lamp.JPG/1200px-Cold_Cathode_Fluorescent_Lamp.JPG","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E9%99%B0%E6%A5%B5%E7%AE%A1","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E9%99%B0%E6%A5%B5%E7%AE%A1"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XwV03"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dfa6947-1cff-4cdd-9317-42de73ed7edd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(色即是空 = 色っていったら空色にきまってんだろ) なんつて","ts":"1635430461.044000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"smile_cat","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D7BGh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d13dee2-3efc-41f0-8af2-1a73250d93dd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕が最初に秋月に通ってた頃は、まだ青色LEDが存在してなかったわ…","ts":"1635430440.043500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4w/lc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fe1bf7a-0eff-4725-b660-fa04d92480c0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"アイコンからも分かる通り青色が好きなもんで","ts":"1635430364.042600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IP41"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0946abb2-a3df-493f-b44b-91f1f64aa78b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"昔青色LEDの光ってるのが好きで秋月電子通商で注文して無駄に光らせて眺めてたな","ts":"1635430348.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"26kn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"939680dd-398c-4fed-9ca3-4eb00824f8ae","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ちょっとしか分からないのでなんで電源がちっさくなるかとかは輪郭しか知らない","ts":"1635430323.041800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fals